  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Requires TestFramework.Core 0.6.0. DockerWebEnvironment now declares its definitions as the run's resources and provides only those, so one run can reach a containerised API and a deployed one; an identifier nothing declares is refused by the engine before anything starts. REMOVED: the UsedSqlIdentifiers, UsedApiIdentifiers, UsedStubIdentifiers and UsedSiteIdentifiers properties (read EnvironmentResources.Required instead) and the DockerWebDefaults.MsSqlPassword constant (read DockerWebEnvironment.SqlPassword). A browser step now requires the site itself rather than ui.webapp.",
